Z||000012||FIERO JOHN-WI||07-25-2001||01:26 PM||||ARCHIE IT'S THE BLACK LIMO THING AS YOU CALL IT.<BR>ANSWERS TOAYS E-MAILS: I WILL BE POSTING ALL REPLYS ON PENNOCKS BECAUSE I'M GETTING ALOT OF THE SAME E-MAIL QUESTIONS<BR> WHATS LEFT TO DO ?<BR>I HAVE 4 COOLING TUBS NEED TO BE CUT AND WELDED TOGETHER<BR>I TAPE TO SHIFT CABLES TOGETHER (ONLY AS A TEMPLATE) I LAYED THEM IN PLACE TO GET THE PROPER LENGHT , I ALSO DID THIS TO ACCLERATOR CABLE<BR>1 BRACK LINE NEEDS TO BE EXTENDED TO THE BACK<BR>2 TRANNY LINES NEED TO BE EXTENED<BR>BODY WORK IN CENTER NEEDS TO BE COMPLETED MANY, MANY, MANY EXTRA BODY PANELS COME WITH<BR>INTERIOR CENTER SECTION NEEDS TO BE FINISHED OFF AGAIN MANY, MANY, MANY 88 BEECHWOOD PARTS<P>THING DONE: FUEL SYSTEM DONE, VACUUM BRAKE BOOSTER LINE ALREADY EXTENDED, FUEL DOOR CABLE ALREADY GOT, WIRING HARNESS EXTENDED(AS MY POST SAID ABOVE)<P>CAN YOU DRIVE IT? YES, BUT NOT LONG JUST ENOGHT TO DRIVE ONTO A TRAILER (ONCE WIRING IS DONE) REASON COOLING TUBS NOT DONE, TRANNY LINE HOT AND COOL HOSE JUST ROUTED INTO EACH OTHER ON TRANNY, BRAKE VALVE UP FRONT HAS PLUG IN IT SO YOU CAN STOP WITH FRONT BRAKE (UNTIL BRAKE LINE IS EXTENDED) AND SOME ONE WOULD HAVE TO STAND BUY THE TRUNK TO MANUALLY PUT TRANS IN GEAR TO DRIVE (SHIFT CABLE FROM ABOVE) AND YOU WOULD MANAULLY PUSH TRODDLE IN BACK TO MAKE IT GO (AGAIN THINGS NEEDED FROM ABOVE)<BR>NEXT NO I WILL NOT SELL ANY OF THE 88 INTERIOR PARTS SEPERATE.<BR>YES THOSE ARE 88 GT RIMS ON IT<BR>NO I DON'T HAVE THE WING FOR IT, I WAS GOING TO DO IT LIKE THE PROTOTYPE<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000013||FIERO JOHN-WI||07-25-2001||01:42 PM||||YES THE DECK LID DOES HAVE WHOLES DRILLED FOR THE WING, PLUS I HAVE A EXTRA DECK LID WITHOUT HOLES (NOT FOR SALE SEPERATELY) GOES WITH THE CAR.<BR>WHAT ARE THE MANY, MANY, BODY PARTS?  6 OR 8 LONG GROUND EFFECTS SOME CRACKED OR SPLIT BUT LONG ENOUGH TO DO THE CAR, 4 LOWER QUARTERS, ANOTHER ROOF SECTION, EXTRA DECK LID PIECE OF ANOTHER FASTBACK CLIP, 4 OR 8 ROUNDED DOOR MOLDINGS TO MAKE THE MOLDING WORK 3 OR 4 LOWER QUARTERS MOLDINGS 3 0R 4 LOWER QUARTER GROUND EFFECTS<P>YES THE BEECHWOOD STEERING WHEEL AND THE TOUCH TONE STEERING WHEEL AND COLUMN GO WITH THE CAR AND NOT FOR SALE SEPERATELY<P>ARCHIE AND OTHERS MY HOME PHONE # 1-414 817-8038 AFTER 4:30 WEEKDAYS<P><BR>||||reg||1
